==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s (1,000%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shibalien]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[I.M. Phace]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is an exact copy of [[God Willing Grades]], so any strategies used there will also work here.

